  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Projection Sorcery — Innate Technique (18th level)</em></p><p><em>Domain Expansion (rules): full-turn action, 20 CE unless stated, 175-ft radius, 1 minute. When the domain ends you suffer <strong>Technique Burnout</strong> (applied automatically by the module).</em></p><p>Finally, at 18th level, you reach the pinnacle of Projection Sorcery. All creatures in your domain take 8d10 Necrotic damage when they move or take any type of action, since their cells don't follow the 24fps rule.</p>",
